                        <span>iPhone &amp; iPad (Safari)</span>
                    </div>
                    <ol class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-2 list-decimal list-inside pl-1 leading-relaxed">
                        <li>Open this website in <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Safari</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Tap the <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Share</strong> button <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-from-bracket text-brand-600 mx-1"></i> (bottom toolbar).</li>
                        <li>Scroll down and tap <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Add to Home Screen</strong> <i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus text-brand-600 mx-1"></i>.</li>
                        <li>Tap <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Add</strong> in the top right corner.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>

                <!-- Android Instructions -->
                <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-750 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2.5">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                        <i class="fa-brands fa-android text-base text-emerald-600"></i>
                        <span>Android (Chrome)</span>
                    </div>
                    <ol class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-2 list-decimal list-inside pl-1 leading-relaxed">
                        <li>Open this website in <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Chrome</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Tap the <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Three dots</strong> menu <i class="fa-solid fa-ellipsis-vertical text-brand-600 mx-1"></i> (top right).</li>
                        <li>Tap <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Install app</strong> or <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Add to Home screen</strong>.</li>
